      "name": "Stage 3: White Wall Inpainting (Geometry-Preserving)",
      "description": "Inpaints ONLY the wall region with white paint while preserving exact room geometry (corners, window frames, skirting boards). Uses VAEEncode + SetLatentNoiseMask instead of VAEEncodeForInpaint, which previously blurred the masked latent and caused the base model to hallucinate new geometry at high denoise.",
